### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = your-jwt-token-here

### 1. Get optimized URL for image
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Media/optimize?originalUrl=https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/sample.jpg&width=400&height=300&quality=80
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Get optimized URL for video
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Media/optimize?originalUrl=https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/video/upload/sample.mp4&width=800&height=600&quality=90
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get optimized URL without transformations (auto optimization)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Media/optimize?originalUrl=https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/sample.jpg
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Upload image with variants
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Media/upload-with-variants?folderName=course-content
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 5. Upload video with variants
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Media/upload-with-variants?folderName=course-videos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-video.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./path/to/your/video.mp4
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Example URLs for testing optimization:
# Image: https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/v1312461204/sample.jpg
# Video: https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/video/upload/dog.mp4
# PDF: https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/raw/upload/sample.pdf